\fn void Log::Module()
\ingroup logging
\brief Starts the Log module: sets spdlog's default level (`debug`) and line pattern, and flushes all loggers every 3 seconds.

Called first by \srclink{src/Module.cpp,83,Engine::InitializePlugins()}. Defined at \src{src/Log/Module.cpp,53,57}.
*/

