\fn void Log::TeardownModule()
\ingroup logging
\brief Shuts the Log module down: flushes, copies each log file to a timestamped name, then drops every logger.

Called last by \srclink{src/Module.cpp,103,Engine::TeardownPlugins()}. Defined at \src{src/Log/Module.cpp,59,71}. Nothing can be logged after this.
*/

